# x_cluster/checks/sabotage/5110_host_cov_tile.patch re-registered 2026-11-23 (lane patch-recut): zeroes the first row's responsibilities fed to HostOps.moments' gemm_fold_cov only (means and nk keep them), so moments_check's host case reads covariances off the oracle; it fell off when the September cluster-cpu notes were removed (bc2e15d796)
# x_cluster/checks/sabotage/5103_kth.patch retired 2026-11-23 (lane patch-recut): operation removed from the product: bodies.kth_smallest_row's bisection is reached only for k outside 1..n_cols (HostOps.kth since e994c0a85c; the device runs _kth_kernel, 5120), and no caller passes one (meanshift k = max(1, floor(0.3 n)); OPTICS min_samples is refused outside [2, n] by _optics_size); recoverable at 12b8e16a0c; 2026-11-23 lane verify-gaps: the bisection and its branch are deleted (HostOps.kth refuses a k outside 1..n_cols), so nothing is left for an arm to fault
# x_cluster/checks/sabotage/5110_moments_fold.patch retired 2026-11-23 (lane patch-recut): operation removed from the identical product: bodies.xk_cell (the means chain) runs only in _xk_kernel on a FAST build (-D MOJOLEARN_NUMERIC_FAST, Apple GPU targets only: core/package_profile.mojo identical_mode_enabled; confirmed 2026-11-23 lane verify-gaps, DeviceOps.moments returns through _moments_gemm under NUMERIC_IDENTICAL and HostOps.moments always folds through the GEMM), since IDENTICAL moments go through the GEMM on both columns (2106abb96b, c742b57427); identical moments are armed by 5110_gemm_reg_order, 5110_host_gemm_copy and 5110_device_gemm_divide; recoverable at 12b8e16a0c
# x_cluster/checks/sabotage/5121_moments_tile.patch retired 2026-11-23 (lane patch-recut): operation removed from the identical product: _moments_pass_kernel's unrolled chain runs only on a FAST build (-D MOJOLEARN_NUMERIC_FAST; confirmed 2026-11-23 lane verify-gaps) (DeviceOps.moments returns through _moments_gemm under IDENTICAL, c742b57427); identical moments are armed by 5110_device_gemm_divide; recoverable at 12b8e16a0c
